msgstr "https://wordpress.org/plugins/real-accessability/"

#. Description of the plugin
#: real-accessability.php
msgid ""
"An accessibility menu for your website - ready-made profiles, contrast "
"modes, text size and spacing, readable font, reading guide and more, styled "
"in your brand color."
msgstr ""
"Un menu d’accessibilité pour votre site : profils prédéfinis, modes de "
"contraste, taille du texte et espacements, police lisible, guide de lecture "
"et plus encore, aux couleurs de votre marque."

#. Author of the plugin
#: real-accessability.php
msgid "REALMEDIA"
msgstr "REALMEDIA"

